{
  "title": "【疑問】ゼミの座席表で俺の名前だけ「仮」になってる",
  "body": "<div class=\"neko-thread\"><div class=\"neko-res-list\"><div class=\"res\" id=\"res1\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">1：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:05:00 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">大学のゼミで配られた座席表、俺の名前の横だけ「仮」って書いてある。もう三年なのに。教授に聞くべきか？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res2\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">2：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:06:29 ID:B7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">まず正式に入学しろ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res3\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">3：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:08:45 ID:C7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ゼミ生（仮）ｗ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res4\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">4：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:11:48 ID:D7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">席はあるんだろ？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res5\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">5：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:13:07 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ある。窓際の一番後ろ。毎週そこに座ってる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res6\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">6：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:15:13 ID:E7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">仮設住宅みたいな扱いだな</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res7\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">7：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:18:06 ID:F7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">名前は合ってるの？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res8\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">8：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:19:15 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">漢字も学籍番号も合ってる。横に小さく仮</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res9\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">9：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:21:11 ID:G7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ゼミの名簿じゃなく座席表なんだな</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res10\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">10：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:23:54 ID:H7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">教授が鉛筆で書いたとか？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res11\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">11：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:24:53 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ワープロで印刷してある。仮だけ手書きの赤字</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res12\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">12：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:26:39 ID:B7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">赤点の親戚か</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res13\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">13：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:29:12 ID:C7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">お前だけ留年候補にされてる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res14\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">14：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:30:01 ID:F7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">去年からそのゼミ？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res15\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">15：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:31:37 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">今年の四月から。四月は普通だった</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res16\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">16：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:34:00 ID:D7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">いつから仮になった？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res17\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">17：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:37:10 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">先週の火曜。今日も消えてない</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res18\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">18：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:38:36 ID:E7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">火曜日に何かやらかしたんだろ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res19\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">19：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:40:49 ID:H7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">その日の出席は？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res20\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">20：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:43:49 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">出た。発表もした。資料を十二枚配った</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res21\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">21：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:45:05 ID:B7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">十三枚必要だったんだよ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res22\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">22：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:47:08 ID:C7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">一枚足りないと存在が仮になる大学</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res23\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">23：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:49:58 ID:F7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">人数は何人？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res24\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">24：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:51:04 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">教授含めて十二人。資料は足りてる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res25\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">25：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:52:57 ID:G7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">発表内容が仮説だったとか</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res26\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">26：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:55:37 ID:H7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\"><a href=\"#res25\">&gt;&gt;25</a> それで仮なら理系全滅だろ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res27\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">27：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:56:33 ID:D7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">教授に聞けば三秒で済む</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res28\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">28：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 19:58:16 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">教授、講義のあとすぐ研究室に戻るから話しかけにくい</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res29\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">29：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:00:46 ID:B7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ゼミ生（仮）が教授（本）に近づけない</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res30\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">30：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:01:32 ID:F7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">座席表は誰が作るんだ？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res31\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">31：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:03:05 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ゼミ長の四年生。毎週印刷して持ってくる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res32\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">32：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:05:25 ID:H7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">じゃあゼミ長に聞け</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res33\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">33：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:08:32 ID:E7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ゼミ長に「俺、仮なんですか」と聞く勇気</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res34\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">34：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:09:55 ID:B7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ないなら仮のままでいいじゃん</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res35\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">35：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:12:05 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ゼミ長は今日欠席。明日電話してみる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res36\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">36：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:15:02 ID:D7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">連絡先は知ってる？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res37\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">37：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:16:15 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">家の電話番号だけ。携帯は教えてもらってない</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res38\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">38：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:18:15 ID:C7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">2000年なのに伝書鳩かよ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res39\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">39：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:21:02 ID:E7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">家にかけるなら昼は避けろよ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res40\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">40：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:22:05 ID:F7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">仮が付いて困ることは？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res41\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">41：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:23:55 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">特にない。ただ俺の席だけ毎週「仮」</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res42\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">42：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:26:32 ID:H7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">勝手に消したらどうなるかな</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res43\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">43：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:27:25 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">赤ペンで消すのはさすがに怖い</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res44\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">44：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:29:05 ID:G7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">その赤字、毎週書き直されてる？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res45\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">45：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:31:32 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">先週と今週で字が違う気がする</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res46\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">46：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:32:15 ID:C7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">仮の筆跡鑑定始まった</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res47\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">47：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:33:45 ID:F7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">二枚並べて確認しろ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res48\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">48：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:36:02 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">先週の紙は捨てた。誰か持ってるか聞く</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res49\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">49：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:39:06 ID:B7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">証拠隠滅した仮学生</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res50\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">50：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:40:26 ID:H7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">友達にも仮って呼ばれてる？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res51\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">51：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:42:33 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">隣の奴に言ったら「お前まだ仮だったの？」と笑われた</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res52\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">52：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:45:27 ID:D7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">そいつ事情知ってそう</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res53\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">53：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:46:37 ID:F7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">何て意味か聞かなかったの？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res54\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">54：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:48:34 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">聞いたら「知らん」と言われた</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res55\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">55：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:51:18 ID:E7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">友達まで仮対応</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res56\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">56：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:52:18 ID:H7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">明日ゼミ長に電話した結果頼む</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res57\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">57：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:54:05 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">今夜は遅いから明日の夕方に電話する</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res58\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">58：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:56:39 ID:C7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">仮眠まで仮扱い</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res59\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">59：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:57:29 ID:F7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ところで単位の登録は済んでる？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res60\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">60：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/17(火) 20:59:06 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">教務課の履修票にはゼミ名が載ってる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res61\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">61：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 21:01:30 ID:H7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">それなら学籍は大丈夫だろ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res62\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">62：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 21:04:41 ID:B7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">学籍が仮だったら卒業証書も鉛筆書き</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res63\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">63：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/17(火) 21:06:08 ID:C7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">卒業見込（仮）</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res64\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">64：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/18(水) 20:08:22 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">翌日。ゼミ長の家に電話した。本人が出た</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res65\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">65：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/18(水) 20:11:23 ID:D7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">何て言われた？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res66\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">66：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/18(水) 20:12:40 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">「座席表は先輩から引き継いだ原稿を使ってる」と</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res67\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">67：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/18(水) 20:14:44 ID:E7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">先輩って誰だよ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res68\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">68：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/18(水) 20:17:35 ID:F7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">赤字の仮も引き継いだの？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res69\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">69：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2000/10/18(水) 20:18:42 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">そこを聞いたら「たぶん」と言われた</div><