:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">教授が仮を承認するのか</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res80\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">80：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2000/10/18(水) 20:39:54 ID:C7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">これ来週も残るな</div></div></div></div><div class=\"fc2_footer\" style=\"text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;height:auto;\">\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n",
